# REST Client examples (VS Code "humao.rest-client"). Log in first; the session cookie is reused.
@host = http://localhost:5069

### Log in (dev password from appsettings.Development.json)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "oregon" }

### Session
GET {{host}}/api/auth/session

### Save slots
GET {{host}}/api/games

### Generate a story seed (runs a short Temporal workflow on the game worker)
POST {{host}}/api/story-seeds
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tone": "Hopeful", "hint": "a traveling library" }

### Start a new voyage
POST {{host}}/api/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "captainName": "Ada Vance",
  "shipName": "Persistent Mule",
  "tone": "Gritty",
  "difficulty": "Normal",
  "storySeed": "We haul the last seed vault from a dying orbital farm to Willamette Landing."
}

### Health
GET {{host}}/healthz/ready
